            "size": 10,
            "color": "#231f20",
            "weight": 700,
            "style": "normal"
          },
          {
            "text": " atravessar miniaturas oponentes. Para atravessar aliados, gaste ",
            "font": "OptimaLTStd",
            "size": 10,
            "color": "#231f20",
            "weight": 400,
            "style": "normal"
